  "releaseNotes": "0.5.0: a typed model for Flex messages. New: Ozakboy.Line.Messaging.Messages.Flex with FlexBubble and FlexCarousel containers; FlexBox, FlexText (with FlexSpan), FlexImage, FlexVideo, FlexIcon, FlexButton, FlexSeparator and FlexFiller components; FlexLinearGradient and bubble styles; static keyword classes (FlexSize, FlexSpacing, FlexColor, FlexAspectRatio and so on) with value factories, as every valued field is a plain string; new FlexMessage(altText, container), FlexMessage.Container and FlexMessage.Parse, which reads Flex Simulator JSON into the typed model, keeping any node it does not model (an unknown type, an unmodelled field, the deprecated spacer) verbatim as RawFlexComponent or RawFlexContainer so that reading and writing back loses nothing; FlexContainer.GetRawNodePaths. FlexMessage.Validate now checks a typed layout before sending: carousel 1 to 12 bubbles, a bubble needs an area, video only as the hero, baseline boxes holding only text, icon and filler, text xor spans, keyword, px, percent, colour, aspect ratio and angle formats, https image URLs, action labels, and the JSON size; a failure is line.validation.invalid_flex with the layout path in the message and nothing is sent. Raw nodes, RawAction and the verbatim JSON path are not checked beyond the overall size. New error code line.validation.invalid_flex and LineMessagingLimits.MaxFlexCarouselBubbles, MaxFlexBubbleBytes and MaxFlexCarouselBytes; existing codes and categories are unchanged. See https://github.com/ozakboy/Ozakboy.Line/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
